<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT COUNTRY XI BY 36 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT COUNTRY XI BY 36 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>TOOWOOMBA, Australia 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat an Australian Country XI by 36 runs in a limited overs tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores - West Indies 275 for seven in 50 overs (Shivnarine Chanderpaul 123, Sherwin Campbell 65); Australian Country XI 239 all out in 49.5 overs (Michael Robinson 50 not out).</p>
